# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting (Windows Git commonly
# defaults to autocrlf=true, which silently converts the working tree
# to CRLF on checkout even though every blob in this repo is stored as
# LF -- that drift showed up as a whole-repo "everything modified" diff
# during Phase 3 Session 2. This pins the convention so it can't recur).
* text=auto eol=lf
